msgid "How to Read This Page"
msgstr "このページの読み方"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:10
#: 280e412fa329468a83af4eabe297c435
msgid "**Near-term**: areas we expect to improve in upcoming iterations"
msgstr "**直近**: 近いイテレーションで改善優先度が高い領域"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:11
#: 1fd63ea462eb4974bf2c96d66a97c112
msgid ""
"**Mid-term**: work we want to expose more broadly after the current docs "
"and API cleanup"
msgstr "**中期**: 現在の docs / API 整理の後で広げていきたい領域"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:12
#: 187d319281044a9f8a95034de2e9f6f0
msgid ""
"**Long-term**: exploratory directions that are useful but not yet "
"scheduled"
msgstr "**長期**: 有用だが、まだ具体的な時期を固定していない方向性"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:14
#: e02eb2e8dab84dad9e51d0c3b6472f90
msgid ""
"The roadmap is public, but priorities can change based on research needs,"
" maintenance cost, and upstream dependencies."
msgstr "ロードマップは公開していますが、研究上の要請や保守コスト、上流依存の変化によって優先度は変わりえます。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:16
#: 572098d52dd146ff94e94dbf6c18024d
msgid "Near-Term Focus"
msgstr "直近の重点項目"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:18
#: 956ad59a6eea46918ad12eab2fb70994
