msgstr "チュートリアル、ガイド、API リファレンス間の参照強化"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:23
#: 5cac4374cc5f4baf8de21225fc1fd858
msgid "Mid-Term Focus"
msgstr "中期の重点項目"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:25
#: ed52e8e8d3fe4089a33d45caf029a18a
msgid "Broader CLI coverage beyond the current prototype-stage interface"
msgstr "現在は試作段階に留まる CLI の拡張"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:26
#: 02f4311806ea4905ad2331beb0aca4d8
msgid ""
"More analysis workflows for noise characterization and time-frequency "
"studies"
msgstr "ノイズ特性評価や時間周波数解析ワークフローの拡充"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:27
#: 88bd787cb44642ea8acfeb43aa62f8ed
msgid ""
"Expanded interoperability guides for external scientific Python "
"libraries, including reading HDF5 products written by data-preparation "
"tools and importing outputs from interferometer design and simulation "
"packages"
msgstr ""
"外部の科学計算 Python ライブラリとの相互運用ガイドの拡充。データ準備ツールが書き出した "
"HDF5 プロダクトの読み込みや、干渉計の設計・シミュレーションパッケージの出力の取り込みを含む"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:30
#: 4c0f8a02a4dc484fb2dd960e7e79e54e
msgid "More public validation notes for numerical and physics-facing algorithms"
msgstr "数値アルゴリズムや物理前提に関する公開検証ノートの充実"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:32
#: 16c37a709bc04642a2147cd1afd20988
msgid ""
"For how these bridges relate to the surrounding ecosystem, and which "
"projects are deliberately left out of scope, see [Where GWexpy Sits in "
"the GW Python Ecosystem](ecosystem)."
msgstr ""
"これらの連携が周辺エコシステムとどう関係し、どのプロジェクトを意図的に対象外としているかは"
"[GW Python エコシステムにおける GWexpy の位置付け](ecosystem)を参照してください。"

#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:35
#: 8abadd687bd243edaa785b5c085b743d
msgid "Long-Term Directions"
msgstr "長期的な方向性"

