#: ../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy/docs_redesign/explanation/roadmap.md:39
#: 508ac11c1eee4843a0ba168932cb0292
msgid ""
"Potential improvements to theme, search quality, and interactive visual "
"components"
msgstr "テーマ、検索品質、インタラクティブ表示の改善"

